            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Stamped; five plain figures read as 6.10.24. A sixth stamped character follows, printed only in fragments and illegible, so a further figure cannot be ruled out. A thin pen stroke stands well to the left of the stamp."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
